[Options]

[A.]
<P>"Never get caught."
<P>Apollyon
<p>You were ambushed when you were asleep. You had no workshop made and you desperatly try to make one but are caught.
When you land on the island, you are able to break your chains and run. You manage to make a rain workshop and a few ice towers, which you had from a left over battle..
They won't hold for long. You Suddenly get a message from Sun Bandit
<p>~lSun Bandit:~iI have decided to help you, but if i fail, im going to take you for a trip.
<p>~wYou:~yWhere?
<p>~lSun Bandit:~iYou'll find out if we lose.
$Button=Veiw your stuff,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Fight,DoNothing,0





